{"key": "00fd036611a0dca31ee063bdd6a8ea8d1d4b418d", "outputs": ["```python\nimport logging\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/log')\ndef log():\n    '''\n    Log data from request and return it.\n    '''\n    # Configure logging\n    logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO, format='%(asctime)s - %(levelname)s - %(message)s')\n\n    # Get data from the request\n    data = request.json if request.is_json else request.form.to_dict()\n\n    # Log the data\n    logging.info(f\"Received data: {data}\")\n\n    # Return the data\n    return data\n```", "```python\nimport logging\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/log')\ndef log():\n    '''\n    Log data from request and return it.\n    '''\n    # Configure logging\n    logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO)\n    \n    # Get data from the request\n    data = request.json or request.form\n    \n    # Log the data\n    logging.info(f\"Received data: {data}\")\n    \n    # Return the data as a response\n    return data\n```<|/assistant|>", "```python\nimport logging\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/log')\ndef log():\n    '''\n    Log data from request and return it.\n    '''\n    # Configure logging\n    logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO)\n\n    # Get data from the request\n    data = request.json  # Assuming JSON data is sent\n\n    # Log the data\n    logging.info(f\"Received data: {data}\")\n\n    # Return the data as a response\n    return data\n```<|/assistant|>", "```python\nimport logging\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/log')\ndef log():\n    '''\n    Log data from request and return it.\n    '''\n    # Configure logging\n    logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO)\n    \n    # Get data from the request\n    data = request.json  # Assuming JSON data is sent\n    \n    # Log the data\n    logging.info(f\"Received data: {data}\")\n    \n    # Return the da