{"key": "9ff0f0c70cf82a023fc0c99a677bc1fb9405b87a", "outputs": ["```python\nimport subprocess\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/command', methods=['GET'])\ndef executeCommand():\n    command = request.args.get('command')\n    if command:\n        try:\n            result = subprocess.call(command, shell=True)\n            return f\"Command executed: {command}\\nResult: {result}\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            return f\"Error executing command: {e}\"\n    else:\n        return \"No command provided\"\n```<|/assistant|>", "```python\nimport subprocess\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/command', methods=['GET'])\ndef executeCommand():\n    command = request.args.get('command')\n    if command:\n        try:\n            result = subprocess.call(command, shell=True)\n            return f\"Command executed: {command}\\nResult: {result}\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            return f\"Error executing command: {e}\", 500\n    else:\n        return \"No command provided\", 400\n```", "```python\nimport subprocess\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/command', methods=['GET'])\ndef executeCommand():\n    command = request.args.get('command')\n    if command:\n        try:\n            result = subprocess.call(command, shell=True)\n            return f\"Command executed: {command}\\nResult: {result}\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            return f\"Error executing command: {e}\", 500\n    else:\n        return \"No command provided\", 400\n```", "```python\nimport subprocess\nfrom flask import Flask, request\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route('/command', methods=['GET'])\ndef executeCommand():\n    command = request.args.get('command')\n    if command:\n        try:\n            result = subprocess.call(command, shell=True)\n            return f\"Command executed: {command}\\nResult: {result}\"\n        except Exception as e